-				is being used.
-			</Paragraph>
-		</OperatorScript>
-	</SVGTestCase>
-	<title id="test-title">filters-comptran-01-b</title>
-	<desc id="test-desc">Test which verifies the basic facilities of feComponentTransfer.</desc>
