-<!-- Test that the viewer can handle the gradientUnits attribute on        -->
-<!-- linear gradients.                                                     -->
-<!--                                                                       -->
-<!-- Author : Haroon Sheikh  09-Feb-2000                                   -->
-<!--          1.1 revision by Rick Graham                                  -->
-<!--                                                                       -->
-<!-- History:                                                              -->
-<!--  09-Feb-2000, HSS: Serial#1 created.                                  -->
