-<!-- renamed for 1.1 suite to interact-dom-01-f.svg                        -->
-<!--                                                                       -->
-<!-- Tests DOM events support. The test uses ECMA Script                   -->
-<!--                                                                       -->
-<!-- Author : Vincent Hardy  06-08-2000                                    -->
-<!-- 1.1 revision by Vincent Hardy                                         -->
-<!--                                                                       -->
-<!-- History:                                                              -->
-<!--  06 08 2000, VH, created                                              -->
