-<!--                                                                      -->
-<!-- Test that the two basic image formats that are allowed in tiny       --> 
-<!-- (jpg ang png) are understood.                                        -->
-<!--                                                                      -->
-<!-- Author : Tim Thompson 3/16/00                                        -->
-<!-- Revised for 1.1 : Rick Graham Feb/05/2002                            -->
-<!--                                                                      -->
-<!-- History:                                                             -->
-<!--  20-mar-2000, serial#1 created.                                      -->
